2 #uuid "0bcc9f93-4f3c-5124-8641-edf082f5099b" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657612 1074 "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)=6\\log_{5} x$ and $v(x)=\\ln x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =(6\\log_{5} x)^{′}\\ln x+6\\log_{5} x(\\ln x)^{′} \\\\  & =(\\frac{6}{x \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}})(\\ln x)+(6\\log_{5} x)(\\frac{1}{x}) \\\\  & =\\frac{6\\log_{5} x}{x} + \\frac{6\\ln x}{x\\ln 5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657613 1068 #edb/ref 17592186657630 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657613 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657613 1071 "Given that $f(x) = x^{-2}\\log_{4} x$, find $f^{′}(x)$." 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657613 1072 #uuid "18f3eb93-e574-5f5a-8279-040ddcf04567" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657613 1074 "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)=x^{-2}$ and $v(x)=\\log_{4} x.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x) \\\\  & =(x^{-2})^{′}\\log_{4} x+x^{-2}(\\log_{4} x)^{′} \\\\  & =(- \\frac{2}{x^{3}})(\\log_{4} x)+(x^{-2})(\\frac{1}{x \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}) \\\\  & =x^{-3}(-2\\log_{4} x + \\frac{1}{\\ln 4})\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657614 1075 #edb/ref 17592186657610 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657614 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657614 1077 "field-1" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657614 1078 #edb/ref 17592186657610 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657614 1079 #uuid "23643de0-4f04-5b7d-97e1-51f4725c1a04" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657615 1080 "\\left(10\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{x \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657615 1082 #edb/ref 175