^{x}}{x \\ln{\\left(7 \\right)}}$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657619 1072 #uuid "726b77c9-4439-577a-8549-9ccc83c65f8b" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657619 1074 "Here, we have the product of the two functions $u(x)={2}^{x}$ and $v(x)=\\log _{7} (x).$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)+u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x) \\\\  & ={({2}^{x})}^{′}\\log _{7} (x)+{2}^{x}{(\\log _{7} (x))}^{′} \\\\  & =({2}^{x}\\ln  (2))(\\log _{7} (x))+({2}^{x})(\\frac{1}{x\\ln  (7)}) \\\\  & ={2}^{x}\\ln  (2)\\log _{7} (x)+\\frac{{2}^{x}}{x\\ln  (7)}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657620 1080 "\\frac{x^{3} + 4}{x}" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657620 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657620 1083 #uuid "7d4fe52b-b7be-5dfe-9a62-a9bb807e825c" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657621 1080 "\\left(8\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{x \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657621 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657621 1083 #uuid "921c17d0-1976-5b3a-915c-86d80055277b" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657622 1080 "\\left(12\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{x \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657622 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657622 1083 #uuid "96e424aa-4e93-575f-89d4-05f0f2353484" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657623 1068 #edb/ref 17592186657618 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657623 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657623 1071 "Given that $f(x)=\\tan(x)\\log(x),$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n**Hint:** $\\log(x)=\\log_{10}(x)$\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=$\n{{field-1}} $+\\,\\frac{\\tan{\\left(x \\right)}}{x \\ln{\\left(10 \\right)}}$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657623 1072 #uuid "b796de74-72c4-529b-b038-a4d67224a125" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657623 1074 "Here, we have the product of two functions $u(x)=\\tan(x)$ and $v(x)=\\log(x).$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =(\\tan(x))^{′}\\log(x)+\\tan(x)(\\log(x))^{′} \\\\  & =(\\sec^{2}(x))(\\log(x))+(\\tan(x))(\\frac{1}{x\\ln(10)}) \\\\  & =\\sec^{2}(x)\\log(x)+\\frac{\\tan(x)}{x\\ln(10)}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657624 1080 "\\left(9\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{x \\ln{\\left(5 \\right)}}\\right)" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657624 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657624 1083 #uuid "bffd7eb9-1ef0-5aae-98d8-18005e448afe" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657625 1080 "\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)} \\sec^{2}{\\left(x \\right)}}{\\ln{\\left(10 \\right)}}" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657625 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657625 1083 #uuid "c94a4fb8-5d4b-51de-9265-fdf1204cf1e0" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657626 1080 "\\left(-2\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}}{x^{3} \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}\\right)+\\left(0\\right)\\left(\\frac{1}{x^{3} \\ln{\\left(4 \\right)}}\\right)" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657626 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657626 1083 #uuid "d8b56f65-2f66-5f41-a6d1-e135ab1d87f1" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657627 1068 #edb/ref 17592186657631 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657627 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657627 1071 "Given that $f(x)=({x}^{3}+4)\\ln(x),$ find ${f}^{′}(x).$\n\n$f^{\\prime}(x)=3 x^{2} \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}\\,+$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139538363 17592186045443 true] [17592186657627 1072 #uuid "dd5b6598-4397-5f58-8be5-6a17f6668cbf" 13194139538